        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9022P, Back-To-Back Ultima IV Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Ultima IV Door Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of 2 door pulls. This modern door pull set is a great addition to contemporary business buildings as well as residential properties. Omnia's BTB-9022P Back-To-Back Ultima IV Pull Set is available in 12 inch and 18 inch sizes. Choose from a beautiful selection of modern finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ultima IV Omnia 9022P Back-to-Back Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-9022P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-9022P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair with 2 door Pulls</i>\r\n</p>",
